  "notes": "A playful 'Palantir for family trips' parody: GitHub-dark palette (#0d1117/#161b22, #58a6ff blue, #d29922 amber, #3fb950 green) and ops-room language ('UNCLASSIFIED // FAMILY OPS', 'Command Center', 'Venue Intel', 'Critical calls'). Near-square 2px corners, hairline #30363d borders, no shadows. Tiny tracked uppercase eyebrow labels above every heading. Meal cards squeeze title into a narrow column so words wrap one per line. Selected card gets blue outline and #1f2a34 fill, mirrored by the right aside header. Status badges: blue 'ASSIGNED', amber 'PENDING'. The page scrolls within the panels. 'Note to task' converts notes into tasks."
